    platform `rocky9`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG RHEL-09-271085: RHEL 9 must conceal, via the session lock, information previously visible on the`
    description `RHEL 9 must conceal, via the session lock, information previously visible on the display with a publicly viewable image.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `rhel9,stig,disa-stig`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:RHEL-09-271085,NIST-800-53:AC-11(1)`
